# The shell scripts must have LF endings or they will not run on Linux or macOS,
# and the generators emit LF, so the sources they read are pinned to LF too.
# Without this, the stored endings depend on each contributor's core.autocrlf.
*           text=auto eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.ps1       text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
